## Gate Pass Protocol

To pass a gate:
1. ✅ Complete all criteria checkboxes
2. ✅ Run validation commands successfully
3. ✅ Document evidence in Notes section
4. ✅ Update status to "passed"
5. ✅ Record pass date
6. ✅ Update state.md with gate pass
7. ✅ Unblock dependent sprints

---

## Gate Status Definitions

| Status | Meaning | Next Action |
|--------|---------|-------------|
| **pending** | Criteria not met | Continue work |
| **validating** | Testing in progress | Wait for results |
| **passed** | All criteria passed | Proceed to next phase |
| **failed** | Validation failed | Fix blockers, retry |
| **blocked** | External dependency | Wait for unblock |

